{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Hello, I don't think we've had a chance to meet either.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:08:44.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864418055409238026","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Secel gave a nod. \"Indeed. It is a pleasure to meet you both, Lady Lovlatar and Roy Gat.\" She then turned slightly and raised an eyebrow slightly. \"Maybe. You seem.. familiar. Have we met before?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:09:25.575000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864418227605340160","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"||Please, call me Sabrine. I am just as anyone else here.||","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:09:57.097000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864418359818321920","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Well, my name is Sera, short for Seraxa. And this is Orphy, short for....\" she pauses.  \"I actually don't know.\" She crouches down to look at Orphy, who makes a series of clicks with his claws. They seem to be in conversation. \"Orphy isn't short for anything.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:09:59.012000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864418367851200532","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"to Seraxa, ||...I apologise if this question is intrusive, but is Orphy your guide?||","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:10:33.132000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864418510959935508","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Nice to meet you too. And just Roy will suffice, but don't tell my family that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:11:58.750000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864418870067462174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Oho! You have weirdo mind words!\" She picks up the crab and puts it on her head. \"Orphy is my familiar.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:12:01.765000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864418882713026570","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"||Familiar, I believe that was the term others used, yes... Please tell me. Is it true that deceased guides---familiars can be recalled in some manner? My Kukudh... They were killed by Redcoats yesterday.||","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:13:10.558000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864419171252961301","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
