{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Secel looked at Sabrine and Roy. \"As you wish, Sabrine and Roy.\" She then turned towards Seraxa. \"It is a pleasure to meet you, Sera and Orphy. I am Secel, warrior cleric of Athena.\" She once again gave the same bow as before.","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:14:31.595000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864419511145988096","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Seraxa squints. \"Have you ever died, Orphy? .... You have? .... It's my fault? Why don't I know about this?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:14:53.179000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864419601676763166","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"She sighs. \"Anyway. Yes, familiars can be resummoned. I think. I don't have the best head about these things.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:15:23.796000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864419730092720138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
