{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"she covers her mouth and sighs in relief, a few greyish tears rolling down her face. ||Please, if it isn't too much trouble, do you know how? I woke up after my... disfiguring incident... with Kukudh there, and if I summoned them somehow I don't recall it.||","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:17:15.665000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864420199306100736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"You need like, a bunch of incense.\" She pulls out her Book of Shadows. \"Here's all the arcane mumbo-jumbo you need to cast the spell.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:18:14.646000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864420446690345000","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"she studies it, making mental notes of what she needs to get. ||Thank you. I--we--are in your debt.||","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:19:16.339000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864420705449934868","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"She gave a small shrug. \"Maybe I saw you somewhere at some point, or someone who looked like you.\" She then rubbed her eyes for a few seconds before looking between the three, simply listening.","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:19:45.675000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864420828494299136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Wait! Were you in the sewers?\" She says in a teasing sort of tone, a grin on her face.","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:20:16.297000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864420956930834442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Her eyes widened slightly, and then gave her a look. \"Is the smell still on me?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:21:54.380000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864421368321015818","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"I shouldn't be surprised this place has big sewers, I suppose, but I don't know if I want to know how it is in there, if the ground level is already bad.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:22:08.915000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864421429286273054","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Oh yeah, smells pretty rank too. And then someone filled it with poison gas.\" Seraxa looks at Secel. \"How did you get out? I was pretty damn convinced that that weirdo old guy was just gonna keep dragging us along until we all choked.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:23:34.964000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864421790201937991","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Honestly, I have no real idea. I simply followed along, and Athena guided me to survival. How about you? Did you run into much trouble?\" Secel then placed a hand on her hip, and her other hand began playing with the holy symbol.","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:26:36.726000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864422552566628402","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Eh. We ran out and lived. I had to force Orphy to disappear or else he would have choked on all the gas.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:27:43.032000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864422830674280458","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"I wish I could do that...\" She then went a little quiet before saying; \"I wonder who tried to kill all of us...\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:30:01.032000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864423409487577118","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\".... We could try to find out?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:30:15.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864423471882698792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"to Secel, ||...I'm sorry, but by 'all of us', do you mean there was more of you?||","created_at":"2021-07-13T08:30:23.569000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864423504015654943","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
